  "fullDescription": "This pack includes 14 cute lemon-themed stamp brushes for the Procreate app.\n\nThe set features charming lemon-inspired elements such as whole lemon, lemon slice, lemon basket, lemonade jar, lemon branch, lemon jam jar, lemon cake slice, lemon bow, lemon drink glass, lemon flower, lemonade pitcher, lemon wedge, and lemon tree in pot.\n\nAll elements are illustrated in a soft, cohesive, rounded style with sweet decorative details, making them perfectly coordinated and easy to combine into fresh citrus-themed compositions.\n\nThese Procreate doodle stamps are ideal for creating stickers, planner spreads, bullet journals, junk journals, digital scrapbooking layouts, recipe cards, kitchen art, summer designs, social media graphics, printable projects, and cute food-themed illustrations.\n\nYOUR PURCHASE INCLUDES:\n\n14 Stamp Brushes (.brushset file)\n\nA complete set of 14 lemon-themed stamp brushes designed for cute illustrations, citrus designs, planner stickers and digital stationery.\n\nThese stamps are not pressure sensitive and can be used with Apple Pencil, third-party stylus, or even your finger.\n\nYou can easily adjust the color, size, and opacity of each brush inside Procreate.\n\nCompatible with Procreate version 4.1 and above.\n\nHow to import:\n\nAfter downloading the files, open your Files app and double tap (or right-click) the .brushset file — it will automatically import into Procreate.",
